<!-- ============================================ 
  Síntesis de la lección (discusión de cierre)
=================================================  -->
<subsubsection xml:id="lec-organizarObjetosEnArreglos-sintesis" component="profesor">
  <shorttitle><custom ref="synthesis-leccion-titulo"/></shorttitle>
  <title><custom ref="synthesis-leccion-titulo"/></title>
  <title component="profesor"><nbsp/>([@@@@@@@@@] mins)</title>

  <p>[+++++++++++++++]</p>
  <p><q>Hoy organizamos objetos en arreglos y describimos cómo se relacionan los arreglos con los grupos iguales</q></p>
<p><q>¿En qué pensaron cuando organizaron los cubos en arreglos?</q> (I dealt the cubes into equal groups and then arranged them into an array. I thought about equal groups I could use to make the total and made each group a row with the same number of things in each row. I arranged them until there were the same number of cubes in each row and the same number of cubes in each column.)</p>

</subsubsection>



